### Login to get token (run first — copy accessToken from response)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@termchat.dev",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Create #general channel
POST http://localhost:3000/channels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "general",
  "description": "General discussion"
}

### Create #random channel
POST http://localhost:3000/channels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "random",
  "description": "Off-topic chat"
}

### Create #engineering channel
POST http://localhost:3000/channels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "engineering",
  "description": "Tech talk"
}

### List all channels
GET http://localhost:3000/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get channel by id
GET http://localhost:3000/channels/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get messages for channel (empty initially)
GET http://localhost:3000/channels/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get messages with cursor pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/channels/1/messages?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No auth — expect 401
GET http://localhost:3000/channels
